          their own controls and the opt-outs above.</>
        )}
      </p>

      <h3>EEA and UK (GDPR)</h3>
      <p>
        If you are in the European Economic Area or the United Kingdom, you have the right
        to access the personal data held about you, to have it corrected or erased, to
        restrict or object to processing, and to data portability. You also have the right
        to lodge a complaint with your national data protection authority.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Access, portability, correction and erasure:</strong> we hold no personal
          data of our own to produce, correct or erase. Your favourites are erased by
