        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Objection and restriction:</strong> there is no profiling or automated
          decision-making by us. Where advertising or analytics is running, the consent tool
          and the opt-outs above are how you object to it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Withdrawing consent:</strong> where consent has been given, you can
          withdraw it at any time, and it must be as easy to withdraw as it was to give.
          <a href="#do-not-sell">The privacy controls</a> above are that route.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs</strong> are held by our host, not by us. Requests about them
          are directed to GitHub, whose privacy statement governs them.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The data controller for this site is <strong>Bleepboard</strong>,
        Office 36A, UFONE Tower, Blue Area, Islamabad, Pakistan. Requests about
        your data go to the contact address at the bottom of this page.
      </p>
      {/* Controller identity supplied by the owner 2026-08-29. Still open, and
