        does not send the play request described above. Your browser does fetch the player
        and the audio file from bleepboard.com, which means the request reaches our host in
        the same way as any other page request, and is subject to the same server logs
        described below.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site the embed appears on is a different matter entirely. That site has its own
        analytics, its own cookies and its own privacy policy, and none of that is under our
        control or covered by this page. The same applies to any advertising it runs around
        the embed.
      </p>
    </div>
